Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}These hands look clean.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:01.31,0:00:02.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Under ultraviolet light?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.83,0:00:04.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}That's training lotion\Nshowing missed spots,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.05,0:00:05.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}not germs.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.17,0:00:08.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Now rewind to\Neighteen forty-seven.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.88,0:00:11.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Ignaz Semmelweis linked\Ndeadly childbed fever
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}to doctors coming\Nfrom autopsies.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.73,0:00:16.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}He introduced chlorinated-lime\Nhand cleaning.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Deaths fell.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Soap washing already existed.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.23,0:00:20.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Today, scrub with soap
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}for at least twenty seconds.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.68,0:00:23.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Between fingers.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.11,0:00:24.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Around nails.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Rinse with clean running water,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.72,0:00:27.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}and dry.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}This simulated\Nbefore-and-after shows
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.67,0:00:31.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}how a tracer can reveal residue.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.87,0:00:34.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Less glow doesn't\Nmean sterile hands.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.57,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}THESE HANDS\NLOOK CLEAN.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.30,0:00:06.17,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\fs27\pos(360,195)}BEFORE WASHING\NFLUORESCENT TRAINING LOTION
