Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.87,0:00:13.73,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\fs28\pos(360,170)}IGNAZ SEMMELWEIS
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.73,0:00:19.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\an5\pos(360,85)}HISTORICAL RECONSTRUCTION
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.23,0:00:22.67,Key,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\fs38\pos(360,195)}SCRUB FOR AT LEAST\N20 SECONDS
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.23,0:00:27.60,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)\an5\fs15\pos(360,325)}MODERN SOAP + WATER · CONDENSED ILLUSTRATION
